im with daemon discovery), src/agent_bridge (stub for future PRs), main.rs Serve/Mcp/Analyze subcommands. Web UI: React+Vite+TS with TopBar/LeftRail/CenterWorkspace/Inspector/Timeline/CommandPalette. ts-rs generates 28 .ts type files into web/src/types/.","timestamp":"20:45:47"},{"id":"debf6080","parent_ids":["cea0624e"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"end-to-end demo verified: serve daemon + WS client + mcp shim, all sharing state via Unix socket. MCP rename_function emits granular function.renamed event with source:claude that reaches WebSocket subscribers instantly. The milestone-1 killer demo (Claude + human editing the same project, watching each other live) works.","timestamp":"20:45:47"},{"id":"f177b072","parent_ids":["debf6080"],"kind":"NOTE","content":"TODO follow-ups: (1) agent_bridge adapters return NotImplemented — wire claude -p / codex exec; (2) cancellation tokens declared but not yet woven through tools::dispatch_inner; (3) auth_token field exists in AppState but middleware doesn't check it yet; (4) functions text-parse in web/api.ts is brittle for non-symbol-table binaries; (5) Inspector lacks xrefs / hash-DB matches / cross-binary panels; (6) Findings UI not yet built (schema + endpoints exist).","timestamp":"20:45:47"},{"id":"270941db","parent_ids":["f177b072"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited .gitignore","timestamp":"20:47:33"},{"id":"e964967e","parent_ids":["270941db"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited .gitignore","timestamp":"20:48:21"},{"id":"3cb91106","parent_ids":["e964967e"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read README.md","timestamp":"20:48:52"},{"id":"762f0ce8","parent_ids":["3cb91106"],"kind":"ACT","content":"wrote README.md","timestamp":"20:49:34"},{"id":"400986fc","parent_ids":["762f0ce8"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read src/tools.rs","timestamp":"20:55:49"},{"id":"f6f6b810","parent_ids":["400986fc"],"kind":"ACT","content":"edited src/tools.rs","timestamp":"20:55:56"},{"id":"1ed5da51","parent_ids":["f6f6b810"],"kind":"OBSERVE","content":"read src/t